        "text": "Sheena what are you building? I'm in the founding team of Parena. Parena is a stablecoin infrastructure built in Solana. What does it allow people to do? So you'll be able to swap between stablecoins seamlessly with cheaper fees and faster rates. And you're also able to deposit stablecoins into our pool to have a deeper liquidity and then that allow people to yield and you'll be able to get a token called USD Stars LP Token and in the future we're going to roll out CTP stablecoin basically backed by real assets such as T bills and other type of ST point within a basket. Cool. How can people try it out? Well just go to perenna P-R-E-A.org there you can take a look at our website and of course try out the beta.",
